的春日午后情绪场域。“清甜”、“元气”、“初恋风”是关键词，传达一种未经雕琢却充满生命力的美好状态。\n\n构图结构：\n中近景特写视角，人物占据画幅70%以上面积，采取略微仰拍角度拉伸脖颈曲线美感，同时利用前景腿部弧线制造层次纵深。苹果位于黄金分割线上方偏右位置，平衡视觉重心。\n\n质感要求：\n皮肤需呈现哑光丝绸般顺滑触感，毛发纤维分明但不凌乱，织物编织纹理真实可辨，金属光泽仅限于苹果表层反射，其余部分保持素雅温润基调。\n\n附加信息：\n作品署名「CHUANYI Studio」应印于左上角，字体简洁现代，不影响观者沉浸体验。\n\n最终目标：\n生成一张兼具商业时尚大片气质与文艺插画韵味的作品，在保证高度还原原始照片神韵基础上，允许适度艺术化演绎，如增加些许梦幻雾霭滤镜或动态虚焦处理，使图像更具故事张力与记忆锚点价值。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 3319, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#004d7a", "size": [1011.6177978515625, 989.5849609375], "pos": [1823.078125, -111.88995361328125], "id": 357, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98354b87a8d3200190", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [2098.73095703125, -224.12188720703125], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {}, "id": 670, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 2}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "workflowRendererVersion": "LG", "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.34.9", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [-704.638201560881, 305.39020900302546], "scale": 0.7247295000000011}}, "groups": [], "links": [[3318, 665, 0, 668, 0, "IMAGE"], [3319, 668, 0, 357, 0, "STRING"]], "id": "13158bd1-c0d9-478e